			"Message": "chore(Air): Migrate SHA256 checksum generation to hex::encode for sha2 0.11\n\nsha2 crate version 0.11 moved `Digest::finalize()` output from `GenericArray` to `hybrid_array::Array`, which no longer implements the `LowerHex` trait used by `format!(\"{:x}\", …)`. Replace all instances with `hex::encode()` from the existing workspace dependency.\n\nChanges applied to:\n- Daemon/Manager (PID-file checksum)\n- Indexing/Scan/ScanFile (file content checksums)\n- Indexing/State/CreateState (index checksums)\n- Security/ChecksumVerifier (integrity verification)\n- Updates/UpdateManager (download verification)\n- Vine/Server/AirVinegRPCService (chunk/file checksums)\n\nThe `hex::encode` function produces the same lowercase hex string as the removed `format!` behavior, ensuring byte-identical checksum output.",
			"SHA": "9932d0d298bc83ce997e34b382a46468666c53a2"
		}
